sentences.text:
In view of the findings on Issue no.1, the petitioner is entitled to the following reliefs: -
a) market value of the land @ Rs.16,74,500 per acre for Category A Land and Rs.16,32,640/- for Category B Land, whichever is applicable, as per statement u/s 19 LA Act.
b) additional amount u/s 23 (1A) @ 12% p.a., on the market value from the date of notification u/s 4 of the LA Act till the date of award or dispossession, whichever is earlier ;
c) solatium u/s 23(2) of LA Act @ 30% on the enhanced amount of market value;
d) interest under Section 28 of L.A Act at the rate of 9% per annum for the first year from the date of dispossession and at the rate of 15% per SIDHARTH MATHUR MATHUR

